<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-bind-on-equip">Best Bind on Equip Items for Feral Druid DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>The above gear list is intended to be appropriate for any fresh Feral Druid in Phase 3, including new players trying out WotLK Classic for the first time, so it excludes expensive BoE items that may be inaccessible to players without previously accumulated gold at their disposal. However, if your Feral Druid is an alt character and you have gold available from playing your main in Phase 2, then there are a couple of BoE upgrades to the above Heroic Plus gear that you can purchase in order to accelerate your Feral's gear progression without relying on raid drops. The BoE list below ranks these items in order of biggest to smallest DPS upgrade from the corresponding Heroic Plus item in that slot. In addition to the two direct BoE upgrades, a handful of items designated as "Downgrade" are listed as early catch-up options that you can use while continuing to farm <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> for superior rewards.<br/>
<br/>
