<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Feral Druid DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41398/relentless-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relentless Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=42153/fractured-dragons-eye">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_dragonseye05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fractured Dragon's Eye</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40117/fractured-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fractured Cardinal Ruby</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49110/nightmare-tear">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_pearl_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Tear</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40125/rigid-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rigid King's Amber</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40148/glinting-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glinting Ametrine</span></a> &gt; <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40147/deadly-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Ametrine</span></a></div></li></ul>As mentioned at the start of this guide, Armor Penetration Rating is now the strongest DPS stat for Feral Druids even at pre-raid gear levels due to the recent changes made to the spec, so <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40117/fractured-cardinal-ruby">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_37.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fractured Cardinal Ruby</span></a> is the default gem to use in every single slot, except when optimizing for a socket bonus. For players who have taken the <a class="icontiny" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=755/jewelcrafting">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Jewelcrafting</span></a> profession, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=42153/fractured-dragons-eye">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_dragonseye05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fractured Dragon's Eye</span></a> is an upgraded version of this gem that you can use in up to three of your sockets.<br/>
<br/>When a piece of gear contains a yellow socket, then gemming for the socket bonus using a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40125/rigid-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rigid King's Amber</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40148/glinting-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Glinting Ametrine</span></a>, or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40147/deadly-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deadly Ametrine</span></a> gem can be optimal when the bonus provides useful DPS stats such as Attack Power or Agility. Likewise, when a piece of gear contains a blue socket with a strong socket bonus, then using a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49110/nightmare-tear">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_pearl_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Tear</span></a> in that slot will generally be optimal, but you should ignore blue sockets entirely once you have used up your one <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49110/nightmare-tear">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_pearl_12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightmare Tear</span></a> allowed per gear set (since it is Unique-Equipped). Remember to be careful with Hit Rating gems or socket bonuses, however, as they provide no value when you are above the relevant Hit cap for your raid environment.<br/>
<br/>Note that in our Phase 3 BiS guide, we discuss the concept of <i>soft caps</i> for Armor Penetration and Crit that impact optimal gemming. However, at pre-raid gear levels, you will always be well below these soft caps and should never need to deviate from Armor Penetration and Agility gems until you acquire raid loot from Heroic <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Feral Druid DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 3</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Head - <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44149/arcanum-of-torment">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_warrior_rampage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Torment</span></a></div></li>
